{"data":{"id":"aJiaGD-7Qn8","slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"pRirgzGogwA","slug":"pyp-carmack-edit","title":"P.Y.P. (Carmack Edit)"},{"id":"AL2rRdFK574","slug":"pyp-acoustic","title":"P.Y.P. (Acoustic)"},{"id":"ZYTj6OS-d7A","slug":"pyp-mr-carmack-edit","title":"P.Y.P (Mr. Carmack Edit)"},{"id":"bAyJNMNWt9E","slug":"pyp-acoustic-version","title":"P.Y.P (Acoustic Version)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"hlzGpquxoWA","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - p.y.p. (Carmack Edit)","track":{"id":"pRirgzGogwA","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit/","slug":"pyp-carmack-edit","title":"P.Y.P. (Carmack Edit)","artist":{"slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy"},"artwork":"images/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Gcem5rNs23M","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - P.Y.P (Carmack edit)","track":{"id":"pRirgzGogwA","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit/","slug":"pyp-carmack-edit","title":"P.Y.P. (Carmack Edit)","artist":{"slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy"},"artwork":"images/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"7vHj7jlvMRk","slug":"156","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-156-w-j"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #156 w/ J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/156.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is joined by Soulection's very own iPhone producer J-Louis.\n\n<!--more-->\nAs some of you may or may not know, J-Louis produces all his music on the iPhone [(Nano Studio App)](https://apps.apple.com/gb/developer/blip-interactive-ltd/id382263654?at=1010lMz4). He even put out a free EP with us in the beginning of the year entitled [\"Balanced\"](https://soulection.bandcamp.com/album/balanced-ep) which was also produced entirely on the iPhone. This 20 year-old from Azusa, CA is really a special guy who we feel is going to be BIG in the near future as long as he stays on track with his progression.\n\nJ-Louis played an exclusive set for a little over 30 minutes with all his recent unreleased productions and then chopped it up with us about his musical background (Drummer since he was 8 years-old & played in a Hardcore band & toured when he was 12) and how he purchased a stolen Macbook Pro (without knowing) to start producing on a computer that was eventually stolen -- forcing him to produce on his iPhone again. \n\nWhat a journey! Joe Kay also made sure to talk about his experience at the Yeezus tour this past Friday and later went into a heavy discussion about rumors of Soulection being part of Free-masonry/Illuminati. Very interesting and informative conversations going on as always.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10844,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"8r9G2pvtMLo","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - p.y.p (Carmack edit)","track":{"id":"pRirgzGogwA","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit/","slug":"pyp-carmack-edit","title":"P.Y.P. (Carmack Edit)","artist":{"slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy"},"artwork":"images/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-carmack-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"sEn8xJtKYWw","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - P.Y.P (Acoustic Version)","track":{"id":"bAyJNMNWt9E","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-acoustic-version/","slug":"pyp-acoustic-version","title":"P.Y.P (Acoustic Version)","artist":{"slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy"},"artwork":"images/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-acoustic-version.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-YbT9jJvLWA","position":47,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - P.Y.P (Acoustic Version)","track":{"id":"bAyJNMNWt9E","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-acoustic-version/","slug":"pyp-acoustic-version","title":"P.Y.P (Acoustic Version)","artist":{"slug":"breezy-lovejoy","title":"Breezy Lovejoy"},"artwork":"images/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-acoustic-version.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"kz6NaaKf248","position":48,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Breezy Lovejoy - P.Y.P (Mr. Carmack Edit)","track":{"id":"ZYTj6OS-d7A","path":"/artists/breezy-lovejoy/tracks/p-y-p-mr-carmack-edit/","slug":"pyp-mr-carmack-e